<title>TURKEY: Turkey sets 9-mth bill auction for Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Turkey sets 9-mth bill auction for Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish central bank said the Treasury would auction on Tuesday nine-month (273-day) t-bills after a one-year bond auction held on October 25.</p>
<p>    Maturity    : August 6, 1997</p>
<p>    Amount	: -</p>
<p>    Coupon	: -</p>
<p>Auction date: November 5, 1996</p>
<p>Value date  : November 6, 1996</p>
<p>-- Istanbul newsroom +90-212-275 08 75 ATA EKS</p>
